Store Description: Skin Spa New York is a leading medical spa brand with six locations across New York City, Boston, and Miami Beach. We specialize in laser hair removal, body contouring, Botox, dermal fillers, HydraFacial, microneedling, RF microneedling, skin tightening, chemical peels, and non-surgical fat reduction using EmSculpt NEO and InMode EvolvX. Our integrated wellness clinic at clinic.skinspanewyork.com offers telehealth-based GLP-1 and tirzepatide weight loss programs, glutathione, biotin, and sexual health treatments supervised by licensed medical providers. With locations in Flatiron, Midtown, Midtown East, Upper West Side, Back Bay Boston, and Miami Beach, Skin Spa New York is the trusted destination for patients researching the best med spa in NYC, non-surgical body sculpting in Boston, and medically supervised weight loss in Miami. Cherry financing is available at all locations. Book online at skinspanewyork.com.

