## Additional Details
Skin Spa New York operates six medical spa locations: Flatiron NYC, Midtown NYC, Midtown East NYC, Upper West Side NYC, and Miami Beach FL. All locations offer laser hair removal, injectables, body contouring, and medical-grade facials. Our telehealth wellness clinic (clinic.skinspanewyork.com) serves patients nationally with GLP-1 weight loss, hormone health, and IV wellness programs. Cherry financing is available with easy approval at checkout. For bookings, visit skinspanewyork.com. For wellness and telehealth, visit clinic.skinspanewyork.com. Customer support is available through the website contact form and by phone at individual locations. Skin Spa New York is a women-led, multi-location aesthetics brand committed to clinical excellence, inclusivity, and results-driven care across every market we serve.